{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "153", "x": 0.8949472934591233, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03879595514451251, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 3", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.12319506908974809, "w": 0.07405254383377506, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): from our research into loneliness. Now, Dev,", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.15152541916388573, "w": 0.6675826502351974, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): okay, Tamara, it's been a real eye opener. I had no idea that", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.17970752416545568, "w": 0.826043886011526, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "loneliness has been increasing steadily for the last 20 years.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2080378742395933, "w": 0.62202727614881, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): I know. And it's the same all over the world. The downside of", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.23636822431373095, "w": 0.8263578174200764, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "a modern lifestyle, I guess.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.26469857438786853, "w": 0.28209243793369976, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Did you come to any conclusions about what the reasons for the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.2930660423122369, "w": 0.8263878572315412, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "increase are?", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.32139637352567824, "w": 0.14658548843349356, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): Well, I'd assumed it was mainly an issue for the elderly. But", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3497267990426009, "w": 0.8267894474755947, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "in fact, it's something which affects young people just as much.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.3780571491167385, "w": 0.6532709868836751, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): So nothing really to do with longer lifespans. Um, what about", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.40638753691226864, "w": 0.8259647367471887, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "social media? In my case, far from making me feel isolated, it actually does the", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4347178869864063, "w": 0.8257725024588047, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "opposite.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.4630482747819364, "w": 0.10344903684470022, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): It definitely does more good than harm. I'd say loneliness has", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.49140337008956114, "w": 0.8263795527102831, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "a lot to do with the way cities are designed. People living in high-rise flats with not", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5197337201636988, "w": 0.8267256769543281, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "much opportunity to speak to their neighbor.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5480641079592289, "w": 0.46213007586949106, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): I think you're right.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.5763944580333665, "w": 0.3826770300940472, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): Another possible reason is that people are having fewer", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6047248458288966, "w": 0.826229866277728, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "children and don't live in large extended family groups.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6330551959030343, "w": 0.5683586923680322, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): But in this country anyway, that all changed decades ago. And", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6612743433120499, "w": 0.8261688639302142, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "yet loneliness is a more recent problem.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.6896046933861876, "w": 0.4147606252504813, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 1 (Tamara): I suppose so. A more plausible explanation is that people are", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7179351189031102, "w": 0.8262933292241332, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "having to move around for work and often end up living miles away from their", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7462654689772478, "w": 0.8260774116714202, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "family and friends.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.7745958190513854, "w": 0.19884309816877105, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): Yeah, it's true. Looking at the studies on health risks and", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8029261691255231, "w": 0.8260530107324147, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "loneliness, there are claims that loneliness has as much impact as smoking 15", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8312565191996607, "w": 0.8259392080336914, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cigarettes a day.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8596116899500704, "w": 0.1792401988450974, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Speaker 2 (Dev): or similar to the risks caused by obesity. But I'm not sure there's", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.8879420400242081, "w": 0.826235607675141, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "enough evidence for some of these claims.", "x": 0.10727675473252624, "y": 0.9162723900983457, "w": 0.44257759319185097, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}